From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:51:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] alert_state round 2 (Codex): redaction covers JSON/URL
 bot token/Authorization Basic/query/db-uri (tested through real messages);
 Telegram result independent of audit (audit failure no longer causes resend);
 lease with owner token + renew + guarded release (expired holder cannot
 delete new holder; state saved only while lease held; send timeout 60s < TTL
 2m); error signature keeps short codes (HTTP 403 vs 500 differ) and drops
 timestamps/uuids/request ids/long numbers

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
